    {
      "text": "PRISMA flow diagram for the review update in children. 14 studies came from the previous review; of 431 new database records (234 duplicates removed), 197 were screened, 63 reports assessed and 54 excluded with reasons listed, and 2 records came from organizations. Nine new studies were included, giving 23 studies in total.",
